[{"title":"同诸生游阴源","author":"吴与弼","text":"山水夙所歆，朋游固其好。\n风雨虽滞淫，穷源竟须到。\n幽意蔚沉沉，归怀晴浩浩。\n良辰不可常，更拟山阴棹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9774,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新堂即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"平生山水心，于焉得休卜。\n一堂虽甚卑，素意良自足。\n坐看风雨来，已喜无沾漉。\n赋诗纪吾成，古人有芳躅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9775,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题凝翠字后","author":"吴与弼","text":"游衍趁良时，欢心慕浴沂。\n饱眈山水趣，书罢更留诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9776,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登连珠峰","author":"吴与弼","text":"阁中罢鸣琴，芳筵谢斟酌。\n扪萝一褰裳，奇峰酬素约。\n天风起萧条，山雨来溟漠。\n时驰千里目，四际云烟薄。\n会当斯结亭，胜览翔寥廓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9777,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸生游倒桐塍","author":"吴与弼","text":"东皋霁甘泽，我心日悠悠。\n出门玩时物，因之白云丘。\n行行不知远，遂历群峰头。\n浩歌酣万态，斜景风飕飕。\n眷言顾诸子，去矣仍夷犹。\n渺然出尘想，奇功归一游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9778,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沼上编茅为亭取程子秋日之诗名曰自得夜坐其中因成此句","author":"吴与弼","text":"幽怀不能寐，揽衣造新亭。\n曲池湛华月，芳树还冥冥。\n群峰远映带，一水近回萦。\n坐久欢未竟，夜迥气逾澄。\n寂感玄化微，伊洛歆馀馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9779,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"卧疴止衡门，何以娱长日。\n卷舒架上书，游戏閒窗笔。\n南亩课农馀，东园薙蔬毕。\n务我分宜然，无劳知难必。\n道泰身自亨，作德心斯逸。\n长歌书座隅，庶用箴吾失。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9780,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石牛埠","author":"吴与弼","text":"时止时行任自然，离离香稻小春天。\n微踪何足符佳梦，自是民彝笃好贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9781,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别熊崇义","author":"吴与弼","text":"不惮风霜跋涉遥，翩然来访白云桥。\n嘉宾盛处归怀好，茂对良辰话久要。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9782,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李章勉学斋","author":"吴与弼","text":"浮生事业易蹉跎，百岁光阴定几何。\n不觉秋霜空满鬓，玩君华扁谩高歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9783,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"携小儿方家坪拜先陇","author":"吴与弼","text":"方家坪侧接连塘，二代铭旌托此藏。\n孱薄每惭荒世德，阃仪空感孝思长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9784,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄朱孟真教谕","author":"吴与弼","text":"青春桃李忆成均，两造高门剑水滨。\n闻说轩车能我顾，无端旧梦欲书绅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9785,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨溪故居","author":"吴与弼","text":"童稚长怀故里居，顾瞻茂草向桑榆。\n溪头细接云仍话，勉尔重新教子书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9786,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲冈道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"疋马寒村偶独过，壮怀莫景怅如何。\n梅花满眼无人问，谩对虬枝一放歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9787,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狭原洪氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"芒鞋又作葛天民，童冠追随五六人。\n绿树池塘投辖处，梅花如雪昼如春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9788,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"四檐风雪夜漫漫，独拥残炉对岁寒。\n细忆晏庭诗思切，是知仁者敢偷安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9789,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中原桥黄氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"忆年童稚饱经过，半百光阴奈若何。\n万事悠悠空白发，一怀慷慨为君歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9790,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪上偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"万缘由命不须嗟，遮莫飞腾莫景斜。\n偶度小桥流水曲，缓从梅下玩孤花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9791,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读韩子","author":"吴与弼","text":"重云密雨锁春寒，病思无端强自宽。\n逝矣古人心独在，遗编一一静中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9792,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄谢王医博高危诸医士李王诸亲友","author":"吴与弼","text":"骥子南游学舜弦，春城淹疾友琴轩。\n神功深赖阳和力，青眼频烦故旧怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9793,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄氏花萼楼","author":"吴与弼","text":"神京曾忝仲联行，乡国相于季氏良。\n花萼楼深春昼永，自天多福一穰穰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9794,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题水竹居","author":"吴与弼","text":"结架媚閒旷，夐然面寥廓。\n水环白云隈，竹带青山郭。\n云霞生我衣，鱼鸟同人乐。\n曰予固静者，煮茗相宾客。\n意遣憺忘归，会心溺洒落。\n缅怀恍如梦，赋诗酬旧约。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9795,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"程庸承府主命李观光章取则皆集小陂讲颜子喟然之章，赋此以勉焉","author":"吴与弼","text":"二生忽喜后先来，无德相资愧尔才。\n黄卷有师当自勉，关闽濂洛是梯阶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9796,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牧大同原杨林坑即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"既辍黄岚游，却入同原嬉。\n三阳时向交，暖律回春晖。\n人情惜旧好，物熊含新辉。\n悠哉四圣心，静向林间窥。\n单骑日日来，飘飘澹忘归。\n偶携二三子，丽泽同箴规。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9797,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与杨珉游大同原","author":"吴与弼","text":"林西日月长，讲罢无馀事。\n东皋策吾马，聊尔川原憩。\n风景惟暮春，烟芳媚初霁。\n理会尘外心，道酣淡中味。\n惠然嘉友来，共此无怀世。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9798,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上作","author":"吴与弼","text":"萧然陋巷日希颜，独把遗经静处摊。\n准拟朝来风日好，遍随晴色踏青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9799,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以事入城假宿西廨彭氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"细雨斜风困马蹄，年过六十未知非。\n客窗辗转难成寐，定力何能一庶几。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9800,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暂寓程庸氏屈府主王侯贲临夜承郎君伴宿","author":"吴与弼","text":"春风堂上降鸾凰，瑞气祥烟日正长。\n翠竹碧梧歌不足，高烧银烛夜煌煌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9801,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中偶述","author":"吴与弼","text":"花木沈沈庭寂寂，苍苔尽日稀行迹。\n支赜窗下一沈吟，人间几片韩山石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9802,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"吴与弼","text":"一棚新架白云端，四达天风九夏寒。\n野性惯随樵牧侣，时时来此独危冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9803,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东坑幽涧","author":"吴与弼","text":"一水泠泠逗密林，无名花草匝幽阴。\n苔矶终日不知暑，涤尽平生扰扰心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9804,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题菊窗","author":"吴与弼","text":"清霜篱落任天真，可信虚窗别有春。\n陶屈依稀千载后，餐英裛露岂无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9805,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿熊玑氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"江湖远适为求医，首寓高斋惬故知。\n良夜好天忘倦处，清风明月细谈诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9806,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发孔家渡","author":"吴与弼","text":"茫茫新涨漾晴洲，华发宁知非胜游。\n未了平生山水债，又从临汝附扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9807,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次打石港","author":"吴与弼","text":"当年曾此泊晴湾，细读邹书向夜残。\n始信万缘端有命，欲为君子却诚难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9808,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭傅秉彝","author":"吴与弼","text":"独步来寻洗墨池，秋风禾黍正离离。\n一丘旧隐成春梦，非恸夫人而为谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9809,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"守风青草洲","author":"吴与弼","text":"青草洲边几日留，风来北极正飕飕。\n个中欲问行藏意，未达中庸是我忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9810,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅舟人","author":"吴与弼","text":"徒窃虚名实陆沈，慇勤空负秉彝心。\n那由回得西风驭，截日深功断自今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9811,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南康舟中","author":"吴与弼","text":"满怀今古怅悠悠，举目江山尽胜游。\n华发又堪来几度，可无新句咏清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9812,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"志喜","author":"吴与弼","text":"袅袅风帆快客程，良朋时共话平生。\n忽惊蜀浪半江浊，又接淮山一带青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9813,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重宿南庄","author":"吴与弼","text":"四十年前此寓居，华颠重宿意何如。\n不堪潦倒浑无似，谩托狂歌寄我吁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9814,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙井道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"石壁话龙湫，青山梦里游。\n长亭新霁雨，随处咏高秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9815,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次练潭","author":"吴与弼","text":"半野云烟薄，长空新月多。\n息肩知有处，灯火练潭河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9816,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横山双港道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"晴色添诗况，山名认上音。\n无劳乡国梦，日咏古人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9817,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁中即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"尽日文章慨作家，?冥楼阁寂无哗。\n云山时独揽秋色，风露谁同玩月华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9818,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"窗间独坐","author":"吴与弼","text":"阁上诗应罢，窗间月复明。\n好怀未忍寐，端坐忆平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9819,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠江渊","author":"吴与弼","text":"久重才华识俊英，偶从此地共茅亭。\n几时更对何乡榻，细写江东渭北情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9820,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月十二夜何家圩玩月","author":"吴与弼","text":"访古微私不易酬，心期江汉日悠悠。\n行藏信有平生分，谩向凉天咏素秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9821,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墙下对淮山独坐","author":"吴与弼","text":"徐步閒来藉草吟，淮山面面感人深。\n若为飞度晴岚表，一览中原畅夙心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9822,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四夜同李进士玩月","author":"吴与弼","text":"别却乡园纵远观，前期浩荡路漫漫。\n何如今夜高秋月，万里清光此共看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9823,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别何家圩道中口占授宜之","author":"吴与弼","text":"昨夜巡檐同霁月，今朝联辔共秋山。\n恍思三十年前梦，信是人生会合难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9824,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠李春","author":"吴与弼","text":"天柱峰前忆旧知，江湖秋兴总如飞。\n金台早得春消息，好寄东风汝水西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9825,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻南庄李氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"淮水秋风归兴浓，片帆日指大江东。\n满门长幼俱青眼，华发何时又一逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9826,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独步江岸","author":"吴与弼","text":"江岸逶迤独步来，日光恰喜密云开。\n能消几两南风力，咫尺青霄是凤台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9827,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次西梁矶","author":"吴与弼","text":"西梁矶下系孤蓬，矶自峨峨水自东。\n蓂荚不知经几换，几人曾此咏和风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9828,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登西梁矶尾","author":"吴与弼","text":"暂纵棱层咫尺踪，江山一览已增雄。\n脱令病骨生轻翰，飞步危巅又不同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9829,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江边独步","author":"吴与弼","text":"咫尺金陵到尚难，朔风犹未退狂澜。\n平芜渺渺不知处，独数江南江北山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9830,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"具庆堂为桐城黄金题","author":"吴与弼","text":"爱汝清溪寿二亲，云笺晴染坐生春。\n九天会沐恩波阔，戏綵堂前百福新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9831,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永感堂为桐城朱善题","author":"吴与弼","text":"欲报劬劳慨昊天，青灯耿耿思绵绵。\n顾我旧游挥客泪，与君同废蓼莪篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9832,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别金陵道次五显旧游口占授章余李三友","author":"吴与弼","text":"客中欣遇二三生，送送无端故国情。\n佳丽山川同一览，楼台高下凤凰城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9833,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅次晓立","author":"吴与弼","text":"江湖日夜数归期，乾鹊声声晓为谁。\n篱菊忽惊银灿烂，畦蔬时接翠葳蕤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9834,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次东馆头","author":"吴与弼","text":"侵星问道高桥侧，斜日息肩东馆头。\n欲卜前程知有在，霁行潦止不须愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9835,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿杜家村","author":"吴与弼","text":"杜家桥外杜家村，细雨斜风暮到门。\n多谢主人怜老大，盘飧杯酒夜温存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9836,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"句容樊知州宅","author":"吴与弼","text":"饱听邦民颂去思，玉楼人去已多时。\n阳春白雪惭吾辈，流水高山吊子期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9837,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿徐村","author":"吴与弼","text":"跋涉泥途不惮劬，晚晴又得旅怀舒。\n清溪濯足看山罢，松竹林头认寓居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9838,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿案头","author":"吴与弼","text":"癖性从来厌市墟，息肩时托近乡居。\n金风禾黍秋连野，绿柳池塘月照庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9839,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发丹阳","author":"吴与弼","text":"遥牵高缆别丹阳，明日青山指浙江。\n谓我何求宁足校，寸心对越是苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9840,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中九日","author":"吴与弼","text":"去年九日遥思子，今日重阳子忆亲。\n自昔怀居非达士，由来安土属吾人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9841,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕城坝","author":"吴与弼","text":"云散青霄月放明，时闻前岸浩歌声。\n平生湖海希踪迹，始向丹阳识坝名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9842,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚墅铺","author":"吴与弼","text":"晴穫农人喜，安流舟子閒。\n平林戚墅铺，迥野浙西山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9843,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏州绝句次唐诗韵 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"万态循环故复新，尘寰知换几回春。\n我来又发姑苏咏，可信浮沤等昔人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9844,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏州绝句次唐诗韵 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"斜风细雨菊花天，今夜何知此水眠。\n他日旧乡谈旧迹，青山却意梦中船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9845,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴江县","author":"吴与弼","text":"一棹吴江上，寒烟枫落时。\n无才堪赋咏，聊诵古人诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9846,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次嘉兴","author":"吴与弼","text":"程程客路问前踪，又系城头槜李篷。\n怀古心期何处写，一江烟浪雨冥濛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9847,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中晓望","author":"吴与弼","text":"吴江欲尽越山来，东日融融霁景开。\n桑柘稻粱连沃壤，人烟村落在无怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9848,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安坝","author":"吴与弼","text":"崇德桥头暮刺船，迢迢江岸带星牵。\n长安坝上停篙处，杨柳阴中伴月眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9849,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望越中山","author":"吴与弼","text":"牵路晴明不惮难，船头时见越州山。\n前程信有自然妙，莫把天心当等閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9850,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平林舟中 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"尽日舟行不见山，离离香稻映柴关。\n倚篷独咏凝晴望，何处云端一翠鬟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9851,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]